ull,{"children":"Attend all follow-up and patching appointments to prevent amblyopia"}]]}],["$","li","In adults, manage underlying conditions (diabetes, thyroid disease) that may contribute to squint",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-success)] shrink-0 mt-0.5","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"In adults, manage underlying conditions (diabetes, thyroid disease) that may contribute to squint"}]]}],["$","li","If a new squint develops suddenly in an adult, seek urgent medical attention",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-success)] shrink-0 mt-0.5","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"If a new squint develops suddenly in an adult, seek urgent medical attention"}]]}]]}]]}]
